cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AegisQ-HPC: Communication-Aware Distributed Quantum Simulation with Post-Quantum Secure Job Provenance"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Aksoy
    given-names: Pinar
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/0xpinara/AegisQ"
abstract: >-
  AegisQ-HPC is a research prototype distributed quantum state-vector
  simulator. It partitions the state vector across MPI ranks, selects a
  communication-aware qubit-to-rank mapping, instruments all distributed data
  movement, and protects job submission and result provenance with the
  NIST-standardised post-quantum primitives ML-KEM and ML-DSA.
keywords:
  - quantum simulation
  - high performance computing
  - MPI
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - reproducible benchmarking
